Explanation of the change:

- We removed the empty stub that—under the hood—was filtering out features based on an incorrect extent test.
- Instead we always call `setStyle` and then forward the feature’s geometry to `drawGeometry`, which itself will handle any required clipping or viewport checks.
- This guarantees that `drawFeature` will work regardless of where on the globe the feature lives.
